# Item Changes

``embed:svelte:
<SectionPreview type="item" names={["Crushing Fists", "Cursed Relic", "Diviner's Kevlar", "Echo Shard", "Ethereal Shift", "Frenzy", "Fury Trance", "Lifestrike", "Mystic Shot", "Restorative Locket", "Scourge", "Slowing Bullets", "Spirit Burn", "Spiritual Overflow", "Suppressor", "Tankbuster", "Weighted Shots"]} />
