=item:crushing-fists:
[[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/items/weapon/crushing_fists.webp]]
## Crushing Fists
- Max stacks stun duration increased from 0.5s to 0.75s
- Bullet Resist reduction increased from -4% to -5% per stack
=

=item:cursed-relic:
[[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/items/spirit/curse.webp]]
## Cursed Relic
- No longer has -14% Damage Output innate
- Now applies a -25% Damage Output debuff for the 3.25s duration
=

=item:diviner-s-kevlar:
[[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/items/vitality/diviners_kevlar.webp]]
